# Career-Ops Project Rules (Cursor adapter)

This project is CLI-agnostic. The canonical instructions live in `AGENTS.md`
at the project root — read it first on every session, before responding.

@AGENTS.md

## Cursor-specific notes

- Slash commands like `/career-ops`, `/career-ops-scan`, `/career-ops-apply`
  are aliases for the skill in `.agents/skills/career-ops/SKILL.md`.
  In Cursor Composer, type them literally and the skill will load.
- User personalization lives in `modes/_profile.md` and `config/profile.yml` —
  never edit `modes/_shared.md` for user-specific content.
- User-layer files (`cv.md`, `config/profile.yml`, `modes/_profile.md`,
  `data/*`, `reports/*`, `output/*`) are gitignored and never auto-updated.

